{"term":{"label":"義","occurrences":11,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"7A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i","title":"盡心上","description":"孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"五","id":"五"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"士","id":"士"},{"form":"失","id":"失"},{"form":"居","id":"居"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"性","id":"性"},{"form":"敬","id":"敬"},{"form":"文","id":"文"},{"form":"樂","id":"樂"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"老","id":"老"},{"form":"食","id":"食"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.15415067982725836,"source":"仁","target":"君子"},{"weight":0.8472978603872037,"source":"仁","target":"心"},{"weight":0.5596157879354227,"source":"仁","target":"性"},{"weight":1.6582280766035324,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":0.44183275227903923,"source":"仁","target":"居"},{"weight":1.8123787564307907,"source":"敬","target":"義"},{"weight":0.8960880245566357,"source":"樂","target":"義"},{"weight":1.589235205116581,"source":"樂","target":"君子"},{"weight":1.4069136483226263,"source":"君子","target":"性"},{"weight":1.001448540214462,"source":"君子","target":"心"},{"weight":0.7137664677626809,"source":"君子","target":"義"},{"weight":1.1837700970084166,"source":"君子","target":"食"},{"weight":0.5959834321062976,"source":"君子","target":"居"},{"weight":2.1000608288825715,"source":"君子","target":"五"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"失","target":"士"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"失","target":"義"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"失","target":"五"},{"weight":1.7227665977411035,"source":"失","target":"老"},{"weight":1.589235205116581,"source":"事","target":"何"},{"weight":2.2823823856765264,"source":"事","target":"士"},{"weight":1.589235205116581,"source":"食","target":"義"},{"weight":2.505525936990736,"source":"士","target":"何"},{"weight":1.8123787564